    "body_html": "<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detailmodule_dynamic\"><strong data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i1.98cb450bM0ct3k\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:20px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-weight:700 !important;\">Backlit Single Phase Two Wire LCD Digital Display Wattmeter Power Consumption Energy Meter kWh AC 230V 50Hz Electric Din Rail</strong></div>\n\n<div class=\"detailmodule_dynamic\"><widget data-widget-type=\"customText\" id=\"19906209\" title=\"\" type=\"custom\"></widget></div>\n\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<p style='box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;font-family:\"white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;color:#000000;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;margin:0px;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;'>\u00a0<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:22px;max-width:100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700 !important;\">Features:</strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p style='box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;font-family:\"white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;color:#000000;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;margin:0px;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;'><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;max-width:100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. Compared with the traditional meter, this product looks small and beautiful, light weight, easy to install!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style='box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;font-family:\"white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;color:#000000;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;margin:0px;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;'><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;max-width:100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2. The traditional maximum current meter is 4 times the rated current, the product is smart meters, overload capacity</span></span></p>\n\n<p style='box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;font-family:\"white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;color:#000000;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;margin:0px;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;'><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;max-width:100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Up to 12 times the base reference current</span></span></p>\n\n<p style='box-sizing:border-box;font-size:14px;font-family:\"white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;color:#000000;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;margin:0px;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;'><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;max-width:100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">3. This product is measured by LCD digital power, no reset button, to avoid human tampering with the data!</span></span></p>\n\n<div style='box-sizing:content-box;font-size:14px;font-family:\"white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;color:#000000;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;'>\u00a0 <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;max-width:100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700 !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;background-color:#ffff00;\">The meter is multifunctional rotation display real Voltage , real Current , real Power , total Energy KWH</span></strong></span></span>\n</div>\n\n<div style='box-sizing:content-box;font-size:14px;font-family:\"white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;color:#000000;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;'>\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700 !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:22px;max-width:100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Parameters:</span></span></strong><br>\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;max-width:100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Maximum current: 80A</span></span><br>\n<spa