\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;max-width:100%;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1 pcs Energy meter</span></span>\u00a0\u00a0\n\n<p><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H027e482f4d7c40f987fc272c0beacefam.jpg\" style=\"width:1000px;\" alt=\"80a din rail single phase two wire lcd digital display power consumption energy electric meter kwh ac 220v 230v 50hz/60hz\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hfaf03f2382d24e5ba83ed3ec24d70e37r.jpg\" style=\"width:1000px;\" alt=\"80a din rail single phase two wire lcd digital display power consumption energy electric meter kwh ac 220v 230v 50hz/60hz\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hbd605ba8acd14ac49dae8da09e1d9fe5L.jpg\" style=\"width:1000px;\" alt=\"80a din rail single phase two wire lcd digital display power consumption energy electric meter kwh ac 220v 230v 50hz/60hz\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Ha85f81e410f442568912ff8f848f4e58l.jpg\" style=\"width:1000px;\" alt=\"80a din rail single phase two wire lcd digital display power consumption energy electric meter kwh ac 220v 230v 50hz/60hz\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hc06526b8f8ef494484287d48e15accd8N.jpg\" style=\"width:1000px;\" alt=\"80a din rail single phase two wire lcd digital display power consumption energy electric meter kwh ac 220v 230v 50hz/60hz\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H4b301d99114c4e40b88a5d14c328e9b4X.jpg\" style=\"width:1000px;\" alt=\"80a din rail single phase two wire lcd digital display power consumption energy electric meter kwh ac 220v 230v 50hz/60hz\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Heb75a58c423a49d7ae48eaef605a5f50N.jpg\" style=\"width:1000px;\" alt=\"80a din rail single phase two wire lcd digital display power consumption energy electric meter kwh ac 220v 230v 50hz/60hz\